Forge attribution

Forge is a Python coding-agent project inspired by Pi and built from a
renamed, adapted Python product baseline derived from Tau. The projects are
separate products; Tau is not claimed to be a complete or line-by-line Pi
replica.

Pi (primary architecture and learning source)
  https://github.com/earendil-works/pi

Tau (Python implementation baseline)
  https://github.com/huggingface/tau
  Tau's MIT license is retained in LICENSE.

Forge adds a LangChain Python create_agent/astream runtime and maintains its
own provider-neutral event, session, tools, and CLI contracts.
